{
 "announcement_id": "cysh-131766",
 "school_id": "cysh",
 "title": "【漏洞預警】CISA新增5個已知遭駭客利用之漏洞至KEV目錄(2025/04/07-2025/04/13)",
 "source_url": "https://www.cysh.cy.edu.tw/p/406-1008-131766,r19.php",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "轉發 台灣電腦網路危機處理暨協調中心 TWCERTCC-200-202504-00000007",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "1.【CVE-2025-31161】CrushFTP Authentication Bypass Vulnerability (CVSS v3.1: 9.8)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【是否遭勒索軟體利用:已知】 CrushFTP在HTTP授權標頭中存在身份驗證繞過漏洞，允許遠端未經身份驗證的攻擊者以任何已知或可猜測的使用者帳戶(例如：crushadmin)進行身份驗證。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【影響平台】請參考官方所列的影響版本 https://crushftp.com/crush11wiki/Wiki.jsp?page=Update#section-Update-VulnerabilityInfo",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "https://crushftp.com/crush11wiki/Wiki.jsp?page=Update#section-Update-VulnerabilityInfo",
     "url": "https://crushftp.com/crush11wiki/Wiki.jsp?page=Update#section-Update-VulnerabilityInfo"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "2.【CVE-2025-29824】Microsoft Windows Common Log File System (CLFS) Driver Use-After-Free Vulnerability (CVSS v3.1: 7.8)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【是否遭勒索軟體利用:已知】 Microsoft Windows的通用日誌檔案系統(CLFS)驅動程式中存在記憶體釋放後使用漏洞，允許授權的攻擊者在本機提升權限。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【影響平台】請參考官方所列的影響版本 https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-29824",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-29824",
     "url": "https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-29824"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "3.【CVE-2025-30406】Gladinet CentreStack Use of Hard-coded Cryptographic Key Vulnerability (CVSS v3.1: 9.8)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【是否遭勒索軟體利用:未知】 Gladinet CentreStack存在使用硬體編碼加密金鑰漏洞，此漏洞與應用程式管理用於 ViewState完整性驗證的金鑰方式有關。若被成功利用，攻擊者可偽造用於伺服器端反序列化的ViewState有效負載，從而實現遠端程式碼執行。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【影響平台】請參考官方所列的影響版本 https://gladinetsupport.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gladinet/securityadvisory-cve-2005.pdf",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "https://gladinetsupport.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gladinet/securityadvisory-cve-2005.pdf",
     "url": "https://gladinetsupport.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/gladinet/securityadvisory-cve-2005.pdf"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "4.【CVE-2024-53150】Linux Kernel Out-of-Bounds Read Vulnerability (CVSS v3.1: 7.1)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【是否遭勒索軟體利用:未知】 Linux Kernel在USB-audio驅動程式中存在越界讀取漏洞，該漏洞允許本機具備權限的攻擊者取得潛在的敏感資訊。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【影響平台】",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● Linux 5.5 至5.10.231(不含)的版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● Linux 5.11 至5.15.174(不含)的版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● Linux 5.16 至6.1.120(不含)的版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● Linux 6.2 至6.6.64(不含)的版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● Linux 6.7 至6.11.11(不含)的版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● Linux 6.12 至6.12.2(不含)的版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "5.【CVE-2024-53197】Linux Kernel Out-of-Bounds Access Vulnerability (CVSS v3.1: 7.8)",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【是否遭勒索軟體利用:未知】 Linux Kernel在USB-audio驅動程式中存在越界存取漏洞，該漏洞允許具有實體存取權限的攻擊者透過惡意USB裝置，竄改系統記憶體、提升權限或執行任意程式碼。",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "【影響平台】",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "● Linux 2.6.12 至4.19.325(不含)的版本",
   "links": []
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
